### Test Statistics Report API
### File này dùng với VS Code REST Client extension hoặc IntelliJ HTTP Client

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7084
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Login để lấy token (thay email và password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "your_password"
}

### 2. Test Preview Report - Full options
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/academic-year-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "academicYear": "2024-2025",
  "includeClassRewardTable": true,
  "includeStudentRewardTable": true,
  "includeWeeklyTrendCharts": true,
  "includeDistributionCharts": true,
  "includeAllClasses": true,
  "includeAllStudents": true
}

### 3. Test Preview Report - Chỉ overview
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/academic-year-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "academicYear": "2024-2025",
  "includeClassRewardTable": false,
  "includeStudentRewardTable": false,
  "includeWeeklyTrendCharts": false,
  "includeDistributionCharts": false,
  "includeAllClasses": false,
  "includeAllStudents": false
}

### 4. Test Preview Report - Chỉ charts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/academic-year-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "academicYear": "2024-2025",
  "includeClassRewardTable": false,
  "includeStudentRewardTable": false,
  "includeWeeklyTrendCharts": true,
  "includeDistributionCharts": true,
  "includeAllClasses": false,
  "includeAllStudents": false
}

### 5. Test Export PDF
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/academic-year-report/export?format=pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "academicYear": "2024-2025",
  "includeClassRewardTable": true,
  "includeStudentRewardTable": true,
  "includeWeeklyTrendCharts": true,
  "includeDistributionCharts": true,
  "includeAllClasses": true,
  "includeAllStudents": true
}

### 6. Test Export Excel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/academic-year-report/export?format=excel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "academicYear": "2024-2024",
  "includeClassRewardTable": true,
  "includeStudentRewardTable": true,
  "includeWeeklyTrendCharts": true,
  "includeDistributionCharts": true,
  "includeAllClasses": true,
  "includeAllStudents": true
}

### 7. Test Error - Năm học không tồn tại
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/academic-year-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "academicYear": "9999-9999",
  "includeClassRewardTable": true,
  "includeStudentRewardTable": true,
  "includeWeeklyTrendCharts": true,
  "includeDistributionCharts": true,
  "includeAllClasses": true,
  "includeAllStudents": true
}

### 8. Test Error - Thiếu năm học
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/academic-year-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "academicYear": "",
  "includeClassRewardTable": true,
  "includeStudentRewardTable": true,
  "includeWeeklyTrendCharts": true,
  "includeDistributionCharts": true,
  "includeAllClasses": true,
  "includeAllStudents": true
}

